ic) trends were assessed during 2014–2018.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"A test for linear trend is significant if an overall statistically significant decrease or increase occurs during the study period.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For all analyses, p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Dashes indicate data are statistically unreliable because the sample size was <50 or the relative standard error was >30%.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}